### 1. Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create Enquiry (Pricing SOP Match)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Alice Smith",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Hi, I am looking to get a price quote. How much do your SMB plans cost?"
}

###

### 3. Create Enquiry (Booking SOP Match)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Bob Johnson",
  "channel": "email",
  "message": "Hello, I want to book a slot for a meeting to discuss standard operating procedures."
}

###

### 4. Create Enquiry (Technical SOP Match)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Charlie Brown",
  "channel": "call",
  "message": "My connection is broken, getting a database login error when I try to save. Help!"
}

###

### 5. Create Enquiry (No SOP Match -> Auto-Escalation fallback)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Diana Prince",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Hey there! I am just browsing around, having a lovely day."
}

###

### 6. Get History & Status Timeline (Replace ID with actual ID returned, e.g. 1)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/history
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Get History & Status Timeline (For Auto-Escalated, e.g. ID 4)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/4/history
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Schedule Follow-up (Replace ID with actual ID)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 15,
  "message_template": "Hi Alice, checking back to see if you have any questions on pricing packages."
}

###

### 9. Manual Agent Escalation (Replace ID with actual ID)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/2/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Bob requested a call-back from a manager specifically."
}

###

### 10. Check Health check with DB connection active
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json
